%% AS-BUILT approval path: Submit, then Approve or Reject. DRAFT: hand-written source, rendered with mcp-mermaid 0.4.1 (generate_mermaid_diagram).
%% Notes cite file:line. Citation table and inferred list: as-built-citations.md.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Person as Approver or Admin
  participant UI as Web UI (app.js)
  participant MW as SessionAuthMiddleware
  participant SS as SessionStore
  participant RR as RequireRoleAttribute
  participant AU as AuthController
  participant IC as InvoicesController
  participant AC as ApprovalsController
  participant SV as ApprovalService
  participant RP as InMemoryInvoiceRepository

  Note over Person,RP: Sign-in (AuthController.cs:23-36)
  Person->>UI: username and password
  UI->>MW: POST /api/auth/login
  Note right of MW: SessionAuthMiddleware.cs:19 skips the token check for login
  MW->>AU: pass through to AuthController
  AU->>SS: Create(UserSession) after matching appsettings Users (AuthController.cs:26-34)
  AU-->>UI: token (16 random bytes as hex) stored in sessionStorage (SessionStore.cs:13, app.js:108)

  Note over Person,RP: Submit a draft (InvoicesController.cs:69-70, no role required)
  Person->>UI: Submit on a Draft row (app.js:52)
  UI->>MW: POST /api/invoices/{id}/submit with Bearer token
  MW->>SS: Get(token) (SessionAuthMiddleware.cs:25)
  SS-->>MW: UserSession
  MW->>IC: next(context) with the session in HttpContext.Items (SessionAuthMiddleware.cs:33), no RequireRole on Submit
  IC->>SV: Submit(id) through Handle (InvoicesController.cs:70)
  SV->>RP: GetById(id)
  RP-->>SV: the stored Invoice instance (InMemoryInvoiceRepository.cs:27)
  Note right of SV: ApprovalService.cs:20 only Draft may be submitted, else 409
  SV->>RP: Update(invoice) status PendingApproval (ApprovalService.cs:26-27)
  SV-->>IC: Invoice
  IC-->>UI: 200 with the Invoice JSON (ApiControllerBase.cs:13)

  Note over Person,RP: Decide a pending invoice (ApprovalsController.cs:21-27)
  Person->>UI: Approve or Reject (app.js:72-73)
  UI->>MW: POST /api/approvals/{id}/approve or /reject with Bearer token
  MW->>SS: Get(token)
  alt token missing or unknown
    MW-->>UI: 401 (SessionAuthMiddleware.cs:27-30)
  else session found
    MW->>RR: next(context): MVC runs the filter before the action, it reads the session from HttpContext.Items (SessionAuthMiddleware.cs:33, RequireRoleAttribute.cs:19)
    alt role is not Approver or Admin
      RR-->>UI: 403 (RequireRoleAttribute.cs:21-24)
    else role allowed
      RR->>AC: action runs
      AC->>SV: Approve(id, username) or Reject(id, username, reason) through Handle
      opt Reject with a blank reason
        SV-->>AC: ArgumentException, mapped to 400 (ApprovalService.cs:45-48)
      end
      SV->>RP: GetById(id)
      alt invoice not found
        SV-->>AC: KeyNotFoundException, mapped to 404 (ApprovalService.cs:61-63)
      else found
        alt status is not PendingApproval
          SV-->>AC: InvalidOperationException, mapped to 409 (ApprovalService.cs:65-71)
        else pending
          Note right of SV: Status check and mutation are not atomic, see flag F1
          SV->>SV: set Status, DecidedBy, DecidedAt (and DecisionNote on reject) (ApprovalService.cs:36-39, 53-56)
          SV->>RP: Update(invoice) under the repository lock (InMemoryInvoiceRepository.cs:50-57)
          SV-->>AC: Invoice
          AC-->>UI: 200 with the Invoice JSON (ApiControllerBase.cs:13)
        end
      end
    end
  end
